config MTK_SOC_MODEM
	tristate "MediaTek SoC integrated modem (CCIF control path)"
	depends on WWAN
	help
	  Enables the CCIF control-path driver for MediaTek's integrated
	  LTE modem (MD1), as found in the MT6893. This exposes the AT and
	  remote-filesystem channels as WWAN ports.

	  This is bring-up code: firmware loading, boot handshake and the
	  DPMAIF data path are not implemented yet.

	  If unsure, say N.
